WEBVTT

00:00:01.200 --> 00:00:05.040
Each of the ten Celtic Cross positions
asks a different question.

00:00:05.040 --> 00:00:08.526
This guide goes through them in order,
with a tip for each.

00:00:09.826 --> 00:00:11.306
The cross: cards 1 to 6.

00:00:11.306 --> 00:00:14.822
The centre card names what the situation
is really about.

00:00:14.822 --> 00:00:17.721
Read it as the core theme, not the whole
story.

00:00:19.021 --> 00:00:20.564
The staff: cards 7 to 10.

00:00:20.564 --> 00:00:27.043
The bottom card of the staff is about how you are meeting
the situation: your attitude, stance or habits.

00:00:28.443 --> 00:00:30.805
Have a tarot spread in front of you?

00:00:30.805 --> 00:00:35.595
Photograph it at readmyspread.com, and get
a clear reading, card by card.
